# voxely-token-ssot

One token graph: `:root` / `.dark` plus one `@theme inline` in `src/styles.css`.

Do not add a second `--color-*` palette, teal leftovers, Geist without a loaded font, or hardcoded history/overlay hex except overlay semantic tokens that follow the same light/dark theme.

Scrollbar, canvas, buttons, and HUD colors come from semantic tokens. Overlay HUD follows app theme (`light` / `dark` / live `system`).
